;;; ===============================================================================================================
;;; (8) THE COMPOSITE ROAD f o gamma AND ITS WINDING NUMBER.  f holomorphic on u, gamma a road with trace in u:
;;;     f o gamma is a road with derivative f'(gamma) gamma' (road-holomorphic-image, the derivative read as
;;;     DERIV-ON), and for w off f(trace), ind(f o gamma, w) = (1 / 2 pi i) int_gamma f'(z) / (f(z) - w) dz -- the
;;;     computation in the proofs of Prop 4.20 and Prop 4.24 (the two integrands agree pointwise on [s, t]).
